# W and S mashed from a standstill (manual tapping and rocking). The W taps push, so the speed
# builds; no manual starts below combo.manualStartSpeed (2 m/s), so the first is a Nose Manual at
# 5.1 s, and rocking W, S in it does not balance it: it falls at 7.6 s (7.3 s before the feel audit
# doubled the balance damping) and pays nothing. (A manual
# used to start at walking pace, stop at once and bank its 50-75 points: 942 points a second
# standing still.)
park lab
spawn lab_center
tap up 20..1220 every 4
tap down 22..1222 every 4
run 1300
expect event manualStart count == 1
expect event manualStart{trick=Nose Manual} within 611..615
expect event bail{reason=lost balance on the Nose Manual} within 910..914
expect no event comboLanded
expect skater.score == 0 at end
